  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2203.05 Unsworn Falsification Requirement. All applicants using forms DSSP 258, DSSP 259 and DSSP 247 shall state his or her name and address and execute the application form under penalty of unsworn falsification pursuant to RSA 641:3.\n\nSource. #6491, eff 4-22-97; ss by #8308, INTERIM, eff 4-17-05, EXPIRED: 10-14-05\n\nNew. #9484, eff 6-19-09; ss by #12513, eff 4-12-18",
